Hi @reporter,
This might be intentional to help promote the package, but in case anyone prefers to filter the tip message, the following snippet seemed to work for me:

```python
import logging

class TipFilter(logging.Filter):
    def filter(self, record):
        return "💡 Tip" not in record.getMessage()

logging.getLogger('lightning.pytorch.utilities.rank_zero').addFilter(TipFilter())
```
